title: "MOVER/SIS Intraoperative Hypotension Prediction — Reproduction Package"
abstract: "Analysis code, configuration, audit trail and aggregate results for the development and internal validation of an anchor-based model predicting cumulative intraoperative hypotension burden from pre-induction data in the MOVER/SIS cohort."
